OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early morning mist patches
OL,6,Fwill quickly clear to leave a fine day
OL,7,Fwith light winds and prolonged periods
OL,8,Fof warm sunshine, although western
OL,9,Fcounties like Shropshire and
OL,10,FHerefordshire may remain cloudier.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying mostly clear
OL,13,Fovernight with some patchy cloud in
OL,14,Fthe northwest. With light winds,
OL,15,Fisolated mist will develop once more.
OL,16,FHowever, most places will stay rather
OL,17,Fmild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
