OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FAnother bright and mostly
OL,6,Fsunny day across the region with
OL,7,Ffurther patchy cloud in the northwest.
OL,8,FRather warm in the sunshine, with
OL,9,Ftemperatures above average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FTurning much wetter in the north on
OL,13,FWednesday with some heavy rain but
OL,14,Fstaying mostly dry further south for
OL,15,Fthe next few days. Temperatures return
OL,16,Fto average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
